55
00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:28.380
In the worst case scenario, the R.O.I. is sixty-six to one, assuming higher costs and lower adoption.

56
00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:37.880
Even the worst case (everything goes wrong, adoption is terrible, the engineers quit and the servers catch fire) returns

57
00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:44.140
